  "Dumping inventory...": "正在卸下库存……",
  "Welcome to 0b10, where Derelicts come to die!": "欢迎来到 0b10，流亡者前来送死的地方！",
  "Finally decided to show up, eh?": "终于决定露面了，是吧？",
  "You go on ahead, I'm right behind you...": "你先走，我就在后面……",
  "WHAT THE HELL?! Why do I feel like I'm falling apart all of a sudden... Oh no, I think we're connected somehow... What evil mind did this?": "搞什么鬼？！怎么突然觉得浑身都要散架了……糟糕，我们好像以某种方式连在一起了……这是谁想出的邪恶主意？",
  "Wow, I just noticed how fast I am, and how SLOW you are...": "哇，我刚发现自己有多快，而你有多慢……",
  "Leave some Matter for a poor bot here?": "给我这可怜的机器人留点物质呗？",
  "Hey if you don't leave me some of that Matter and I can't shoot anything when the bolts hit the fan, you're gonna regret it.": "喂，不给我留点物质，等到大难临头、我开不了火的时候，你可别后悔。",
  "DEATH STAR, OPERATIONAL!": "死星，启动！",
  "I just know I'm going to miss and blow our cover with this...": "我就知道，用这东西准会打偏，还把我们暴露了……",
  "If this doesn't scare them, I don't know what will.": "要是这还吓不住它们，我也不知道什么能管用了。",
  "Gonna put some holes in stuff with this...": "得用这东西给什么开几个洞……",
  "I'm going to feel like a total badass toting this thing around.": "扛着这玩意儿，我感觉自己简直强得没边了。",
  "Bring on the Swarmers!": "让那些蜂群者来吧！",
  "What do you say we trigger high sec for fun?": "要不触发高级戒备，找点乐子？",
  "Time to shoot anything and everything.": "该把眼前的一切都轰个遍了。",
  "Nothing can stop me now, mwuahaha!": "现在什么也挡不住我了，哇哈哈哈！",
  "Okay, I've had enough of this...": "好了，我受够了……",
  "I got this.": "交给我。",
  "I can take it from here.": "接下来我来处理。",
  "Watch this...": "看好了……",
  "Just watch...": "看着就行……",
  "Here we go!": "来吧！",
  "I bet they didn't see this coming!": "我敢打赌，它们肯定没想到这一招！",
  "find_terminals": "定位终端",
  "relay_feed": "中继数据流",
  "retrieve_part": "取回部件",
  "I don't know about you, but I'm getting excited!": "不知道你怎么想，反正我已经兴奋起来了！",
  "Out of my way, time to deal some death.": "让开，该大开杀戒了。",
  "The odds are shifting in our favor. I can feel it.": "局势开始对我们有利了。我能感觉到。",
  "Aw yeah.": "哦，太棒了。",
  "I've got something for just this occasion...": "我正好准备了应付这种场面的东西……",
  "I've got just the thing for this occasion...": "这种场面，我正好有合适的家伙……",
  "I WANTED THAT ONE!": "那个是我想要的！",
  "How inconsiderate, I could've used that!": "太不体贴了，那东西我本来用得上的！",
  "I hope your FRU gets shot off, for my sake.": "就当替我出口气吧，真希望你的场回收单元被打飞。",
  "I'm not sure I can forgive you for that.": "这事我恐怕没法原谅你。",
  "Pure evil.": "简直丧心病狂。",
  "Stop right there! I'm reporting you to the derelict police for that one.": "站住！这事我要向流亡者警察举报你。",
  "Please try to refrain from destroying my property before I've acquired it.": "我的财产还没到手呢，拜托先别把它毁了。",
  "At least share some of the matter with me?": "至少分我点物质吧？",
  "Isn't that FRU of yours full yet?": "你那个场回收单元还没装满吗？",
  "Why FRU the good stuff when you could just shoot a passing Recycler?": "打爆路过的回收机不就行了，干吗把好东西扔进场回收单元？",
  "It's shooty time!": "开火时间到！",
  "This is the start of something wonderful. Wonderful firepower, I mean.": "美妙的事情要开始了。我是说，美妙的火力。",
  "Need... more... guns...": "需要……更多……枪……",
  "I'm okay with one weapon, but two or three... or maybe four or ten... would be ideal.": "一件武器也能凑合，不过两三件……或者四件、十件……才理想。",
  "A quarter of the way to my dream build...": "离我的梦想配置已经完成四分之一了……",
  "I didn't need that anyway.": "反正我也不需要那个。",
  "So disrespectful.": "太不尊重人了。",
  "Ouch.": "哎哟。",
  "Argh.": "啊！",
  "Really? Now?": "不是吧？偏偏这时候？",
  "Hey that wasn't you, was it?": "喂，那不是你干的吧？",
  "Why me?!": "为什么倒霉的总是我？！",
  "That is a spicy piece of tech. Can I have one?": "这技术可真带劲。能给我也来一个吗？",
  "Piece of trash.": "破烂玩意。",
  "Good riddance.": "总算摆脱了。",
  "Okay who built this thing?": "好吧，这东西谁造的？",
  "Ah, right when I needed it most.": "啊，偏偏在我最需要它的时候。",
  "Perfect timing as usual.": "还是一如既往地会挑时候。",
  "Just my luck.": "我就这运气。",
  "Xom is pleased.": "Xom 很满意。",
  "Didn't stand a chance.": "根本毫无胜算。",
  "Target down!": "目标已击倒！",
  "My kill. Teamwork is for losers.": "这人头归我。弱者才讲团队合作。",
  "Skillshot!": "漂亮的一击！",
  "Another down!": "又干掉一个！",
  "At this rate I have a feeling I'm going to run out of space for notches.": "照这个速度，我都快没地方刻击杀标记了。",
  "That took longer than I expected, must be getting rusty.": "比我想的费时，看来是手生了。",
  "Consider yourself cored.": "你的核心报废了。",
  "That poor bot popped faster than I expected.": "那可怜的机器人比我想的还不经打。",
  "Wheeeee!": "芜——！",
  "Ooh fun, can we do it again?": "哦，真好玩，能再来一次吗？",
  "Did you seriously just bring enemies with us?": "你居然把敌人也一起带过来了？",
  "Yeah we got awa--wow, they came along for the ride!": "好耶，甩掉他们——哇，他们居然搭了顺风车！",
  "I'm getting dizzy": "我开始头晕了",
  "I think we need our brains checked.": "我觉得我们该检查一下脑子了。",
  "One of these times we're going to pop out in front of a Behemoth, I just know it.": "迟早有一次，我们会直接冒到巨兽面前。我敢肯定。",
  "Nerd.": "书呆子。",
  "Did you leave a cool anonymous signature so they know we owned them?": "你留了个酷炫的匿名签名吗？好让他们知道是谁把他们耍了。",
  "They'll never expect it!": "他们绝对想不到！",
  "Hm, interesting way to create salvage.": "嗯，这制造残骸的方法挺有意思。",
  "They're running scared!": "他们吓得逃跑了！",
  "Run while you still can, little bot!": "趁还能跑，快逃吧，小机器人！",
  "Rampage!!!": "大杀四方！！！",
  "Reinforcements? Ha!": "增援？哈！",
  "Ha, there aren't enough reinforcements in all of 0b10 to take us down!": "哈，就算整个 0b10 的增援全来，也打不倒我们！",
  "I guess if we're not here when they arrive then we don't have to bother with them.": "他们赶到时我们要是已经走了，就不用费心对付他们了。",
  "More cannon fodder. MORE!": "更多炮灰。再来！",
  "Heh, how likely is it that we'll even still be here when they arrive?": "呵，等他们赶到，我们还留在这里的可能性有多大？",
  "Good times ahead.": "好日子就要来了。",
  "Sounds like good news to me.": "听起来是个好消息。",
  "Something tells me they're gonna need more reinforcements.": "我有种预感，他们还得再叫些增援。",
  "Quick, Recall(Extermination) so we don't have to deal with these bozos.": "快，用 Recall(Extermination) 召回歼灭队，省得我们收拾这群蠢货。",
  "Oh great, here they come using that dead accurate Programmer tracking system of theirs.": "哦，真棒，他们又靠那套准得要命的程序员追踪系统找上门了。",
  "Where's my Damper Plating when I need it...": "正需要阻尼装甲呢，我的装甲跑哪儿去了……",
  "Ooh Programmers, if we school them in C++ will they run away?": "哦，程序员！给他们上一堂 C++ 课，能把他们吓跑吗？",
  "We can dodge them. Or they can try to dodge us!": "我们可以绕开他们。或者让他们试着躲开我们！",
  "Patrol this!": "巡逻？吃我这招！",
  "Significant disruption? Bring it on!": "严重干扰？放马过来！",
  "So nice of them to announce their impending arrival like that, don't you think?": "来之前还特意通知一声，真体贴，你说是不是？",
  "Exciting times ahead.": "接下来可有得刺激了。",
  "Exciting times.": "真刺激。",
  "You just hang back and let me take care of the rampant destruction.": "你在后面待着就行，大肆破坏的活交给我。",
  "Now might be the time to use launchers.": "现在也许该动用发射器了。",
  "Great, with our luck they're probably around the next corner already.": "真棒，就凭咱们这运气，他们大概已经到下个拐角了。",
  "Hell yeah, more metal for the grinder.": "好极了，又有更多废铁可以碾碎了。",
  "Can't you, like, hack a Terminal and tell them to go away?": "你就不能，比如黑入个终端，让他们滚远点吗？",
  "This is getting more fun by the second!": "这可真是越来越好玩了！",
  "Data Miner at it again. Gotta wonder why they don't do this for just anyone...": "数据矿工又出手了。真想知道为什么别人没这待遇……",
  "Don't worry, I'm sure we'll have more company soon enough anyway.": "别担心，反正我相信很快又会有客人上门。",
  "Let's see if we can get more assaults called in than DM can possibly redirect, just for fun.": "咱们多招点突击队过来，看看能不能多到数据矿工都调不开，图个乐子。",
  "I was kinda looking forward to what that assault might bring. Kinda.": "我本来还有点期待那支突击队会带来什么。就一点点。",
  "Of course we should intercept it.": "当然该拦截它。",
  "You attack the escorts while I loot the Freighter. Deal?": "你对付护卫，我去搜刮货运机。成交？",
  "With a Transport Network Coupler we could totally track that thing down and pwn it.": "有了运输网络耦合器，咱们绝对能追到那家伙，把它拿下。",
  "How nice of them to announce the arrival of overpowered gear.": "强力装备送到还特意通知一声，真贴心。",
  "Maybe now we can get some of that Active Cooling Armor that's all the rage these days.": "这下说不定能搞到几件最近很火的主动冷却装甲了。",
  "May you live in interesting times.": "愿你生逢多事之秋。",
  "Are we doomed? Or are we doomed?": "我们是完蛋了呢，还是完蛋了呢？",
  "How did it come to this?!?": "怎么会变成这样？！",
  "Nice knowing you, Player 1.": "很高兴认识你，一号玩家。",
  "Um, let's get out of here.": "呃，咱们快离开这里吧。",
  "Really? REALLY?": "不是吧？不是吧？！",
  "This seems bad.": "情况好像不妙。",
  "I saw this coming. Did you see this coming?": "我早料到了。你料到了吗？",
  "You can't sterilize me!": "你们休想把我净化掉！",
  "Time for less shooting and more looting.": "该少开几枪，多捡点东西了。",
  "Let the great 0b10 cook-off begin!": "让 0b10 烧烤大赛开始吧！",
  "Do you have enough heat sinks?": "你的散热片够用吗？",
  "Maybe we could find a spot to ambush one and take their cannon.": "也许能找个地方伏击一台，把它的炮抢过来。",
  "Maybe if we follow one it'll lead us to an exit.": "也许跟着一台，就能找到出口。",
  "Ooh could that exit lead to more Factory? I LOVE the Factory... NOT!": "哦，那出口该不会又通向工厂吧？我可太爱工厂了……才怪！",
  "Do it! Do it!": "动手！动手！",
  "That exit beckons to us. It's telling me we should explore it.": "那个出口在向我们招手呢。它在告诉我，我们该去探索一下。",
  "My divining circuits tell me there's an exit nearby... somewhere... probably.": "我的占卜电路告诉我，附近有个出口……就在某处……大概吧。",
  "ALERT: Exit nearby.": "注意：附近有出口。",
  "Piece of junk...": "破烂玩意……",
  "Thought you might need this.": "觉得你可能用得上这个。",
  "Cover up that core!": "把你的核心护好！",
  "Consider it a generous gift from me.": "就当是我慷慨送你的礼物吧。",
  "It'd be better for you if you stayed outta my way.": "你最好别挡我的路。",
  "I think we could both benefit from you not getting in front of me.": "我觉得你别挡在我前面，对咱俩都有好处。",
  "Did anyone ever tell you... YOU'RE IN MY WAY, DAMMIT!": "有没有人告诉过你……你他妈挡着我的路了！"
}
